{"availability":"available","full":"choyiny/gitorange","name":"gitorange","description":"A self-hosted GitHub for your team, with no servers to run. Single-tenant git hosting with pull requests, built on Cloudflare Workers, D1, and Artifacts.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":12,"forks":1,"created":"2026-10-02T00:04:07Z","updated":"2026-10-03T04:39:14Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://choy.in/gitorange","topics":["cloudflare-artifacts","cloudflare-d1","cloudflare-workers","code-review","git","github-alternative","pull-requests","self-hosted"],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":12,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted GitHub for your team, with no servers to run. GitOrange is a single-tenant git host in the spirit of GitHub Enterprise Server: the GitHub interface your team already knows, private to your organization, deployed as one Cloudflare Worker.","There is no VM, no disk to back up, and no git daemon to patch. Repositories live in Cloudflare Artifacts, Cloudflare's git-compatible storage. Everything else lives in D1.","Bring your GitHub Actions workflows. GitOrange runs the .github/workflows/.yml files you already have, with the same syntax, on Cloudflare Containers. No runners to host. Typical build-and-test workflows (checkout, set up Node, install, test) work unchanged. Repository secrets aren't supported yet. See what's supported."],"features":["First-run setup — the first visitor creates the site admin. After that, sign-up is closed.","Email invitations — admins invite teammates by email (or copy the link); invites are single-use and expire in 7 days.","Unlimited repositories — create empty or with a README; browse files, Markdown READMEs, history, and per-commit diffs.","Syntax highlighting — GitHub's color scheme for 35+ languages in file views and diffs, in light and dark mode.","Work with an AI agent — every repository offers a ready-made prompt (on an empty repo's setup page, and under Code → AI agent) that people who don't use git can paste into Claude Code or another coding agent. The agent…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"82910c61414c7d002a0a0374f0be617b77cae7e7f9232cac913ebca4a8b87b6d","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.844Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.844Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted GitHub for your team, with no servers to run. GitOrange is a single-tenant git host in the spirit of GitHub Enterprise Server: the GitHub interface your team already knows, private to your organization, deployed as one Cloudflare Worker.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted GitHub for your team, with no servers to run.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Prerequisites: a Cloudflare account on the Workers Paid plan (required for Artifacts, currently in open beta), a domain onboarded to Cloudflare Email Sending for invitation emails, and Node.js v20+ with yarn.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Prerequisites: a Cloudflare account on the Workers Paid plan (required for Artifacts, currently in open beta), a domain onboarded to Cloudflare Email Sending for invitation emails, and Node.js v20+ with yarn.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"First successful result: your worker is live, and the first visit asks you to create the admin account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"$5/month for the Cloudflare Workers Paid plan, which Artifacts requires.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"82910c61414c7d002a0a0374f0be617b77cae7e7f9232cac913ebca4a8b87b6d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.844Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T04:39:14Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:42.854Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choyiny/gitorange/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.846Z","hash":"82910c61414c7d002a0a0374f0be617b77cae7e7f9232cac913ebca4a8b87b6d","originalBytes":15931,"storedBytes":15931,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["github","pull","git","actions","docs","files","cloudflare","repository","see","code","every","lfs","request","run","claude","gitorange","artifacts","each","file","first","repositories","live","per","screenshots","server","setup","their","token","agent","branch","job","merge","one","requests","runs","team","workers","workflows","access","account","after","changed","checks","client","line","mcp","personal","plan","push","they","through","auto-merge","change","commit","create","email","open","other","paid","resolved","secrets","shows","site","target","what","when","which","workflow","about","admin","admins","another","architecture","aren","before","between","branches","clone","comments","commits","compatibility","conflicts","container","containers","creates","default","diffs","don","everything","explanation","gb-month","github-actions-compatibility","included","issues","license","logs","model","never","once","only","over","own","page","pricing","read","repo","requests.","resolution","roadmap","same","set","settings","steps","syntax","them","there","tools","under